body:
The cloud session is close to its usage limit. Everything is pushed to branch claude/intelligent-hamilton-vg1f9a (PR #1). Start at research/jit-20261008/HANDOFF.md, then AGENTS.md.

- Run data (gitignored originals): research/jit-20261008/handoff/runs/; model-call journals are in journals.tgz.
- Every workflow's script and its agent results so far: research/jit-20261008/handoff/workflows/.
- Snapshot script: research/jit-20261008/handoff/snapshot.sh. The cloud re-runs it every 10 min for up to 6 h while the container lives, so git pull first.

In flight at handoff: blocker-dossiers, kev-j1-build, engine-stage1-finish, the kinetics JIT dev arms, and records H/H. The jit-profiles-durability workflow finished; 241/241 JIT tests pass.

Rules unchanged:
- no new Workflow fan-outs (owner, usage limits);
- sealed beds are never read; held-out seeds are 7001 and up only;
- do not self-approve heal proposal p-a3336190-r4 (owner only);
- credentials only from env vars.
